state 0

    0 $accept: . translation_unit $end

    $default  reduce using rule 1 (translation_unit)

    translation_unit  go to state 1


state 1

    0 $accept: translation_unit . $end
    2 translation_unit: translation_unit . external_declaration

    $end        shift, and go to state 2
    error       shift, and go to state 3
    STRUCT      shift, and go to state 4
    TEMPLATE    shift, and go to state 5
    TYPEDEF     shift, and go to state 6
    CLASS       shift, and go to state 7
    ENUM        shift, and go to state 8
    UNION       shift, and go to state 9
    PP_INCLUDE  shift, and go to state 10
    PP_DEFINE   shift, and go to state 11

    BOOL       reduce using rule 68 (declaration_prefix_opt)
    CHAR       reduce using rule 68 (declaration_prefix_opt)
    CONST      reduce using rule 68 (declaration_prefix_opt)
    DOUBLE     reduce using rule 68 (declaration_prefix_opt)
    EXTERN     reduce using rule 68 (declaration_prefix_opt)
    FLOAT      reduce using rule 68 (declaration_prefix_opt)
    FRIEND     reduce using rule 68 (declaration_prefix_opt)
